==English==

===Etymology===
From early 1940s, replacing earlier {{m|en|race music}}.

===Noun===
{{head|en|noun}}

# {{lb|en|music genre}} A [[style]] of [[music]] combining elements of [[jazz]] and [[blues]], with [[syncopated]] rhythms and a strong [[backbeat]], originating among [[African American]]s in the 1940s.
#: {{syn|en|R & B}}
# {{lb|en|Cockney rhyming slang}} [[shoes]]

